OL,3,GNEWSAEvacuated Giffnock park reopens
OL,4,Aafter engineers fix gas leak
OL,5,
OL,6,FA park on the outskirts of Glasgow
OL,7,Fwhich was evacuated and temporarily
OL,8,Fclosed due to a gas leak has now
OL,9,Freopened.
OL,11,FPolice Scotland said it was called to a
OL,12,Freport of a burst gas main in Eastwood
OL,13,FPark in Giffnock at about 16:00 on
OL,14,FTuesday.
OL,16,FEast Renfrewshire Council said all
OL,17,Fbuildings within the park were closed
OL,18,Fand activities at the leisure centre or
OL,19,Fpitch were suspended while engineers
OL,20,Fattended.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
